{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16554","headline":"寺居清晨 · 刘复","name":"寺居清晨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高枕对晓月，衣巾清且凉。\n露华朝未曦，滴沥含虚光。\n隔竹闻汲井，开扉见焚香。\n幽心感衰病，结念依法王。\n青冥早云飞，杳霭空鸟翔。\n此情皆有释，悠然知所忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}